@startuml "Génération des billets et envoi de confirmation"

title Génération des billets et envoi de confirmation

participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "QR Service" as QRSvc
participant "Email Service" as EmailSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Génération des billets ==
TicketSvc -> QRSvc: generateQRCodes(tickets)
loop Pour chaque billet
    QRSvc -> QRSvc: Générer QR unique
    QRSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO qr_codes (ticketId, code, data)
end
QRSvc --> TicketSvc: QR codes generated

== Envoi de confirmation ==
OrderSvc -> EmailSvc: sendOrderConfirmation(order, user)
EmailSvc -> EmailSvc: Préparer template email
EmailSvc -> EmailSvc: Attacher PDFs billets
EmailSvc -> EmailSvc: Envoyer email SMTP
EmailSvc --> OrderSvc: email sent

@enduml